  "value": "cities[i] is at (xs[i], ys[i]); names are distinct and so are coordinate pairs. For each queried city name, return the name of the other city that shares its x or its y coordinate and has the smallest Manhattan distance to it, ties to the smaller name in code-point order; return \"NONE\" when no other city shares a coordinate.",
